OL,4,CHospital stops gas and air use over    
OL,5,Csafety fears                           
OL,6,GAn NHS hospital has announced it will  
OL,7,Gsuspend use of gas and air in its      
OL,8,Gmaternity suite over concerns for      
OL,9,Gstaff safety.                          
OL,11,FBasildon Hospital leaders feared       
OL,12,Fpersistently high levels of the gas -  
OL,13,Fknown as Entonox - in the unit could   
OL,14,Fbe causing health issues.              
OL,16,FThe suspension will begin on Thursday  
OL,17,Fand other methods of pain relief will  
OL,18,Fstill be available for women giving    
OL,19,Fbirth, the Mid and South Essex NHS     
OL,20,FFoundation Trust (MSEFT) said.         
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
