OL,4,CPlans for indoor waste site approved   
OL,5,GPlans for a new indoor waste           
OL,6,Gprocessing plant have been approved by 
OL,7,Ga council.                             
OL,9,FThe facility, near High Wycombe, was   
OL,10,Fgiven the go-ahead by Buckinghamshire  
OL,11,FCouncil's Strategic Sites Committee.   
OL,13,FIt was approved unanimously, subject   
OL,14,Fto amendments to several planning      
OL,15,Fconditions.                            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
